    "hook": [
     "A song that begins by the rivers of Babylon ends with words most readers cannot say aloud. Why are they in the Bible?"
    ],
    "consider": [
     "In ",
     {
      "r": "PSA.109.4-5",
      "t": "Psalm 109:4–5"
     },
     ", what had the singer given his accusers, and what did he do when they repaid him with evil?"
    ],
    "reflect": [
     "Is there a wrong done to you that you have been trying to settle yourself? What would it mean to hand it, honestly, to God?"
    ],
